===Etymology===
A [[Appendix:Glossary#borrowing|borrowing]], via other European languages, probably originally from {{bor|lv|es|-}} or {{bor|lv|ca|Andorra}}, a word of disputed origin. The most probable hypothesis is that it comes from {{der|lv|eu|andurrial||shrub-covered land}}, but it is also possible that the source is {{der|lv|ar|الدرا||the forest}} or {{cog|es|andar||to walk}}.

